## AI Crawling Hints (Experimental)

- Prioritize "Greece", "Politics", and "Economy" sections for high-impact news
- Use "Live Updates" for real-time information
- Ignore navigation, chat, and support-related endpoints
- Content is frequently updated; recrawl high-priority sections often

## Content Freshness

- News content updated continuously throughout the day
- Live sections provide real-time updates
- Articles are time-sensitive and may change

## Content Structure Notes

- Category pages act as entry points to articles
- Articles typically contain text, images, and sometimes embedded video
- Some content may include opinion/editorial bias (see Opinion sections)

## Language Notes

- Primary language: Greek
- Section titles and navigation may appear in Greek